# --- Project-specific: outputs/ is shipping-only noise ---
# outputs/ contains one-shot Telegram-shipped PDFs/ZIPs from each release
# round (D2 through D15-CORRECTED3). These are reproducible from the
# code in v0.*-prelim/code/, so they don't belong in version control.
# The build_*.py / append_*.py / apply_*.py scaffolding scripts that
# generated them are also regenerated on demand, so ignore them too.
# If you actually want to ship the latest PDFs, regenerate via the
# build_<round>_pdf.py scripts (they live in the same dir, gitignored).
outputs/

